{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "THE MAZE : in Dark",
    "steam_appid": 2847290,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847290/extras/9e5738a018b36155dbb89e4e9e755083.avif?t=1755414725\" data-has-big width=1600 height=517 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an industrial security officer, you are asked to retrieve important technical documents from a factory that was abruptly shut down about 5 years ago. You sneak into the factory to secure the documents, relying on a small flashlight in the complete darkness. Retrieve the documents deep inside the factory and <strong>safely</strong> escape the place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dark, maze-like factory with only your flashlight while avoiding He, who roams within. Secure the documents and escape safely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Search and Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve retrieved the technical documents stored deep in the dark factory, you must quickly escape. But He won\u2019t just sit back and watch you walk out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Flashlight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The flashlight is your only reliable source of light in the dark factory. It will help you search through the darkness and become your only hope in this pitch-black place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CCTV</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can monitor various parts of the factory via CCTV. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CCTV can be accessed through monitors in the control room. If power is cut off, CCTV will be unavailable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use CCTV to track He\u2019s movements and avoid crossing his path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >He</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is roaming the factory with an axe. If you don\u2019t want to fall victim to it, avoid He while you search and escape.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always stay alert. He may suddenly rush at you from the darkness when you least expect it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use &quot;WASD&quot; to move, &quot;Shift&quot; to sprint, and &quot;CTRL&quot; to crouch. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press &quot;E&quot; to interact with objects such as doors and items. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use &quot;F&quot; to turn your flashlight on or off. See the flashlight section for more details. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press &quot;ESC&quot; or &quot;P&quot; to pause the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847290/extras/9e5738a018b36155dbb89e4e9e755083.avif?t=1755414725\" data-has-big width=1600 height=517 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an industrial security officer, you are asked to retrieve important technical documents from a factory that was abruptly shut down about 5 years ago. You sneak into the factory to secure the documents, relying on a small flashlight in the complete darkness. Retrieve the documents deep inside the factory and <strong>safely</strong> escape the place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objective</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dark, maze-like factory with only your flashlight while avoiding He, who roams within. Secure the documents and escape safely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Search and Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve retrieved the technical documents stored deep in the dark factory, you must quickly escape. But He won\u2019t just sit back and watch you walk out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Flashlight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The flashlight is your only reliable source of light in the dark factory. It will help you search through the darkness and become your only hope in this pitch-black place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CCTV</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can monitor various parts of the factory via CCTV. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CCTV can be accessed through monitors in the control room. If power is cut off, CCTV will be unavailable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use CCTV to track He\u2019s movements and avoid crossing his path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >He</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is roaming the factory with an axe. If you don\u2019t want to fall victim to it, avoid He while you search and escape.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always stay alert. He may suddenly rush at you from the darkness when you least expect it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use &quot;WASD&quot; to move, &quot;Shift&quot; to sprint, and &quot;CTRL&quot; to crouch. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press &quot;E&quot; to interact with objects such as doors and items. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use &quot;F&quot; to turn your flashlight on or off. See the flashlight section for more details. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press &quot;ESC&quot; or &quot;P&quot; to pause the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck!</p>",
    "short_description": "In a pitch dark maze like factory, you must avoid He, secure secret documents, and escape with only a flashlight. If He finds you, He\u2019ll charge from the dark with an axe. Can you survive and escape?",
